## update ingredient popup
PATCH http://localhost:3000/owner/update-stock-ingredients/1
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 1
branch_id: 1
{
  "quantity_in_stock": 100,
  "total_volume": 10000,
  "net_volume": 100,
  "expiration_date": "2026-02-28"
}

POST http://localhost:3000/owner/stock-group
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 1
branch_id: 1
{
    "category_name": "น้ำชง"
}

## create new ingredient
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/create-stock-ingredients
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 1
branch_id: 1
{
  "image_url": "imagepath/image.png",
  "ingredient_name": "ไข่มุก2",
  "net_volume": 100,
  "unit": "g",
  "quantity_in_stock": 10,
  "category_name": "",
